        "Content": "First floor two bedroom apartment. \r\nSpacious and well proportioned accommodation.\r\nFinished to a high standard throughout.\r\nNorth west facing balcony. \r\n2 x designated car spaces. \r\nAnnual Management Fees - 2,760.\r\nSought after location, convenient to a host of amenities.\r\nExtending to approximately 75 sq. m (807 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis modern, well-maintained property features a generous open-plan lounge/diner/kitchen, two comfortable bedrooms � including a master with en suite and a family bathroom. Finished to a high standard throughout, the apartment offers a contemporary and practical living space. A north/west-facing balcony adds a lovely space to catch the afternoon and evening sun, while disc parking for two cars completes the package.Set within a highly sought-after development, No. 14 The Gallery is just a short stroll from the village of Donabate, where residents enjoy a great range of amenities � shops, primary and secondary schools, sports clubs, restaurants, and the popular Keeling's pub.Donabate is well known for its abundance of sports facilities and golf courses, with five located on the peninsula alone. The village train station offers convenient access to Dublin and Belfast via the main Dublin/Belfast line, while the M1 and M50 are both close by. With Dublin Airport just 12km away, the location suits both work and leisure perfectly.\r\n\r\nVacant possession."
